|editor=Gifford, William
|url=https://books.google.com/books?id=6WtVAAAAcAAJ
|others=Act 4, Scene 2
|page=54
|passage='Twill prove a notable '''striker''', like his father.
}}
# {{lb|en|obsolete|politics}} A [[blackmailer]] in [[politics]].
# {{lb|en|obsolete|politics}} One whose [[political]] [[influence]] can be [[buy|bought]].

